{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "各管什么",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 136.43,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "这一集的核心，是一句话。密码学算法几乎从不被破解，被攻破的，是实现。",
   "spoken": "这一集的核心，是一句话。密码学算法几乎从不被破解，被攻破的，是实现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 8.909
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "随机数不够随机，nonce 能被算出，门限签名的库省掉一步证明。",
   "spoken": "随机数不够随机，nonce 能被算出，门限签名的库省掉一步证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 9.98,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 10.078,
   "speechEnd": 15.066
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "私钥的安全上限，由它的生成和使用过程决定。",
   "spoken": "私钥的安全上限，由它的生成和使用过程决定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 16.128,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 16.226,
   "speechEnd": 19.845
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "先给准确的定义。熵，是随机性的度量，单位是位。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的定义。熵，是随机性的度量，单位是位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 20.908,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 21.006,
   "speechEnd": 26.075
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "256 位熵，攻击者要试大约 2 的 256 次方次。只有 32 位熵，约 43 亿次就够了。",
   "spoken": "256 位熵，攻击者要试大约 2 的 256 次方次。只有 32 位熵，约 43 亿次就够了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 27.128,
   "dur": 8.304,
   "speechStart": 27.226,
   "speechEnd": 34.592
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "打个比方。保险柜的密码有 77 位数字，理论上没人猜得出。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。保险柜的密码有 77 位数字，理论上没人猜得出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 35.652,
   "dur": 6.072,
   "speechStart": 35.75,
   "speechEnd": 40.902
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "但如果设密码的人，总用自己的生日加一串固定数字，小偷只要试几万个生日。",
   "spoken": "但如果设密码的人，总用自己的生日加一串固定数字，小偷只要试几万个生日。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 41.944,
   "dur": 7.08,
   "speechStart": 42.042,
   "speechEnd": 48.184
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。小偷试生日，必须站在保险柜前面。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。小偷试生日，必须站在保险柜前面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 49.244,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 49.342,
   "speechEnd": 54.208
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "链上的公钥和地址全部公开。攻击者可以离线、并行、无限次地试，不会触发任何告警。",
   "spoken": "链上的公钥和地址全部公开。攻击者可以离线、并行、无限次的试，不会触发任何告警。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 55.272,
   "dur": 8.712,
   "speechStart": 55.37,
   "speechEnd": 63.141
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "再看几种原语，各自保护什么，不保护什么。",
   "spoken": "再看几种原语，各自保护什么，不保护什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 64.204,
   "dur": 4.248,
   "speechStart": 64.302,
   "speechEnd": 67.611
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "ECDSA 和 EdDSA 用来签名。它们保证，没有私钥的人无法伪造签名。",
   "spoken": "ECDSA 和 EdDSA 用来签名。它们保证，没有私钥的人无法伪造签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 68.672,
   "dur": 7.032,
   "speechStart": 68.77,
   "speechEnd": 74.851
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "但它们不管私钥和 nonce 的质量，也不管用户看没看懂签的内容。",
   "spoken": "但它们不管私钥和 nonce 的质量，也不管用户看没看懂签的内容。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 75.924,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 76.022,
   "speechEnd": 80.343
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "哈希保证数据没被改动，但不保证数据本身是对的。",
   "spoken": "哈希保证数据没被改动，但不保证数据本身是对的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 81.4,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 81.498,
   "speechEnd": 85.759
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "助记词让人能抄写和恢复钱包，但不管生成它时熵够不够。",
   "spoken": "助记词让人能抄写和恢复钱包，但不管生成它时熵够不够。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 86.804,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 86.902,
   "speechEnd": 91.628
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "分层派生，从一个种子派生出一组地址。一份备份恢复全部，一个种子泄露，也全部泄露。",
   "spoken": "分层派生，从一个种子派生出一组地址。一份备份恢复全部，一个种子泄漏，也全部泄漏。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 92.664,
   "dur": 8.52,
   "speechStart": 92.762,
   "speechEnd": 100.331
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "整条链路是这样的。随机数源，到助记词，到种子，再派生出私钥和地址。",
   "spoken": "整条链路是这样的。随机数源，到助记词，到种子，再派生出私钥和地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 101.404,
   "dur": 7.464,
   "speechStart": 101.502,
   "speechEnd": 108.023
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "签名时，私钥、消息，再加一个 nonce，一起算出签名。",
   "spoken": "签名时，私钥、消息，再加一个 nonce，一起算出签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 109.088,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 109.186,
   "speechEnd": 113.709
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "这条链路上，有两处需要随机性。生成私钥时的熵，签名时的 nonce。任何一处出错，私钥都能被算出来。",
   "spoken": "这条链路上，有两处需要随机性。生成私钥时的熵，签名时的 nonce。任何一处出错，私钥都能被算出来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 114.78,
   "dur": 9.816,
   "speechStart": 114.878,
   "speechEnd": 123.768
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "图上没画的，是签名的内容。算法完全正确，用户也可能签下攻击者的交易。所以签之前，要看清签的是什么。",
   "spoken": "图上没画的，是签名的内容。算法完全正确，用户也可能签下攻击者的交易。所以签之前，要看清签的是什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 124.816,
   "dur": 10.416,
   "speechStart": 124.914,
   "speechEnd": 134.411
  }
